[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2640.55, "timestamp": "00:44:00", "text": "等等，这位 YouTuber 是谁？呃，妮娜，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2644.23, "timestamp": "00:44:04", "text": "哦，是的。是的，妮娜。是的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2647.19, "timestamp": "00:44:07", "text": "因为我也不知道，伙计。我 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2650.39, "timestamp": "00:44:10", "text": "最近，我一直在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2652.309, "timestamp": "00:44:12", "text": "因为太投入她的直播了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2654.95, "timestamp": "00:44:14", "text": "我当时就想，我突然意识到为什么是她了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2657.19, "timestamp": "00:44:17", "text": "声音真是可爱极了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2662.23, "timestamp": "00:44:22", "text": "正确的？是的。就像我妻子的声音达到顶峰一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2666.55, "timestamp": "00:44:26", "text": "她的嗓音也达到了巅峰。我当时就想，好吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2669.03, "timestamp": "00:44:29", "text": "妻子能理解，因为她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2672.71, "timestamp": "00:44:32", "text": "也喜欢一个动漫角色。所以，好吧，她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2674.47, "timestamp": "00:44:34", "text": "不能怪我。所以这就解释了为什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2676.39, "timestamp": "00:44:36", "text": "你的 Opera GX 会发出这些噪音。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2679.109, "timestamp": "00:44:39", "text": "拍。这就是为什么我的 Opera GX 有 Ena 的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2682.23, "timestamp": "00:44:42", "text": "我做任何事都会发出音效。一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2686.589, "timestamp": "00:44:46", "text": "V字形图案之类的东西太可爱了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2688.19, "timestamp": "00:44:48", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2691.43, "timestamp": "00:44:51", "text": "好像不仅仅是因为她像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2693.75, "timestamp": "00:44:53", "text": "她的声音很热情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2696.79, "timestamp": "00:44:56", "text": "但她就像个很舒服的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2699.109, "timestamp": "00:44:59", "text": "小妖精。不，不是小妖精。更像是"}]